        <item>
            <title>0.88</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:24:38 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202611270923</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.88</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>A plain folder's office closes even when no session points at it</li>
<li>A plain folder's session reports its branch as HEAD</li>
<li>A session in a plain folder opens no office and gets no title</li>
<li>Plain folders open in the repo list too, and never offer the Trash</li>
<li>Repo actions sit in an Actions menu</li>
<li>A repository's activity is your own sessions and offices only</li>
<li>Titles that don't fit end in "+N more", which lists every repository</li>
<li>A ship the production branch never saw is taken back</li>
<li>Crates stand apart in their stacks, up to five high</li>
<li>Every repository gets a title, newest first, and a click tells its story</li>
<li>Releases into production stay in view: staging never becomes production</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
